abstract: >
  An open-source digital reference for the Kinanah (كنانة) tribe — its history,
  lineage, branches, notable figures (including Quraysh, Banu Bakr, Banu al-Du'al,
  the Prophet Muhammad ﷺ, Imam al-Shafi'i, Abu al-Aswad al-Du'ali), and
  contemporary descendants across the Arabian Peninsula, Egypt, Sudan, the
  Levant, and beyond.
